		<div class="detail-text">
			<p>Cartoon Ladybug has a transparent background. This PNG has a resolution of 2400x1882. You can download the PNG for free in the best resolution and use it for design and other purposes. Cartoon Ladybug just click on Download and save.</p>
			<p class="text-justify">Bugs, plural, is the crowd shot rather than one specimen - clusters, rows, and mixed collections of creepy-crawlies together. Think a marching line of ants, a leaf dotted with aphids, a chart of assorted beetles, a jar of fireflies, and a mixed bug-collection grid, in cartoon and realistic looks. None of them carry a background block, so the whole group drops onto a coloured scene, a photo, or a plain page cleanly. The high-resolution originals keep every tiny body distinct whether you shrink the group into a border or blow it up for a classroom chart. Teachers build identification posters, kids' apps fill levels, and eco sites illustrate biodiversity pieces. Party planners also use them for creepy-crawly themes. Grab the whole lot free of charge for any educational or nature design.</p>
		</div>

